OL,3,GNEWSAOpen water swimming returns to
OL,4,Alake after hiatus
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpen water swimming sessions have been
OL,7,Freintroduced to a west London country
OL,8,Fpark after a two-year break in a bid to
OL,9,Fmeet demand for the "increasingly
OL,10,Fpopular" sport.
OL,12,FSessions are available in the southside
OL,13,Flake known as The Haven in Bedfont
OL,14,FLakes Country Park, Hounslow, on
OL,15,Fselected Tuesdays, Thursdays and
OL,16,FSaturdays and will be overseen by
OL,17,Ftrained staff, Hounslow Council said.
OL,19,FSupervised sessions were previously run
OL,20,Fat the lake until June 2024 and ended
OL,21,Fdue to financial constraints.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
