OL,3,GNEWSAOpen water swimming returns to
OL,4,Alake after hiatus
OL,5,
OL,6,FSalman Shaheen, Hounslow Council's
OL,7,Fcabinet member for environment,
OL,8,Ftransport and public realm, said the
OL,9,Fopen water swimming site was a
OL,10,F"fantastic opportunity" for residents.
